# TODO: Translation updated at 2026-11-28 03:59

# game/case02.rpy:54
translate schinese press_marisa_1_d5539b38:

    # you "And when exactly do you plan to die?"
    you "那么，你打算什么时候死？"

# game/case02.rpy:56
translate schinese press_marisa_1_56da0f24:

    # marisa "Not anytime soon. That's the beauty of it."
    marisa "暂时还不会死啦。妙就妙在这儿。"

# game/case02.rpy:58
translate schinese press_marisa_1_0e07f9f7:

    # eiki "A loan with no due date. I will be writing to the Ministry."
    eiki "没有归还期限的借阅。我会写报告给是非曲直厅。"

# game/case02.rpy:62
translate schinese press_marisa_2_6617e5bf:

    # you "You inspected the dust personally?"
    you "灰尘是你亲自检查的？"

# game/case02.rpy:63
translate schinese press_marisa_2_bd6b9539:

    # marisa "Wiped it off with my sleeve. Didn't want to steal the dust. That'd be wrong."
    marisa "用袖子擦掉了。总不能连灰尘也偷走吧。那可不对。"

# game/case02.rpy:67
translate schinese press_marisa_3_e6cb0fc7:

    # you "Not the only one? Who else?"
    you "不止你一个？还有谁？"

# game/case02.rpy:68
translate schinese press_marisa_3_4909bacb:

    # marisa "Oh, nobody. Just a certain shrine maiden. With a certain donation box."
    marisa "哦，没谁。就是某位巫女。还有某个赛钱箱。"

# game/case02.rpy:69
translate schinese press_marisa_3_dc808abb:

    # marisa "You know what? Put it in the testimony."
    marisa "对了，把这个也写进证词里吧。"

# game/case02.rpy:73
translate schinese press_marisa_4_7ea46083:

    # you "What does Reimu's donation box have to do with your books?"
    you "灵梦的赛钱箱跟你的书有什么关系？"

# game/case02.rpy:75
translate schinese press_marisa_4_0f2d6002:

    # marisa "Everything! If the shrine maiden does it, it can't be that bad, right?"
    marisa "关系大了！巫女都这么干，那也不算多坏吧？"

# game/case02.rpy:77
translate schinese press_marisa_4_64eeb60c:

    # eiki "Reimu's ledger is Reimu's problem. Yours is forty-seven books long."
    eiki "灵梦的账是灵梦的事。你的事有四十七本书那么长。"

# game/case02.rpy:88
translate schinese case2_3af4f096:

    # eiki "Order. The Higan Court of Logic is in session."
    eiki "肃静。彼岸逻辑法庭现在开庭。"

# game/case02.rpy:90
translate schinese case2_b506956e:

    # eiki "Komachi. The defendant?"
    eiki "小町。被告呢？"

# game/case02.rpy:91
translate schinese case2_fbd7043b:

    # komachi "Came in through the window, boss."
    komachi "从窗户进来的，四季大人。"

# game/case02.rpy:92
translate schinese case2_5aa8c5a9:

    # eiki "We have a door."
    eiki "我们有门。"

# game/case02.rpy:93
translate schinese case2_6f355403:

    # komachi "I mentioned that. She said doors are for people with time to spare."
    komachi "我说过了。她说门是给闲人用的。"

# game/case02.rpy:96
translate schinese case2_9e7de451:

    # marisa "Kirisame Marisa, ordinary magician. Let's keep this quick. I've got reading to do."
    marisa "雾雨魔理沙，普通的魔法使。快点结束吧，我还有书要读。"

# game/case02.rpy:99
translate schinese case2_17e8d457:

    # eiki "The charge: removal of forty-seven grimoires from the Scarlet Devil library."
    eiki "罪名：从红魔馆图书馆带走四十七本魔导书。"

# game/case02.rpy:103
translate schinese case2_674fbfd5:

    # marisa "Removal's a strong word. I prefer \"long-term borrowing.\""
    marisa "“带走”说得太重了。我更喜欢叫它“长期借阅”。"

# game/case02.rpy:107
translate schinese case2_ed7ce67f:

    # eiki "Junior Judge. Today's defendant won't deny what she did."
    eiki "见习法官。今天的被告不会否认她做了什么。"

# game/case02.rpy:108
translate schinese case2_50d665ef:

    # eiki "So listen for the excuse instead. Excuses love to dress up as reasons."
    eiki "所以要留意她的借口。借口最喜欢打扮成理由。"

# game/case02.rpy:124
translate schinese case2_c2ff10c4:

    # marisa_t "I borrowed those books. I'll give 'em back when I die. That's a promise."
    marisa_t "那些书是我借的。等我死了就还。我保证。"

# game/case02.rpy:125
translate schinese case2_e431c5d6:

    # marisa_t "Patchouli hasn't opened most of 'em in a hundred years. I checked the dust."
    marisa_t "那些书大部分帕秋莉一百年都没翻过。我查过灰尘了。"

# game/case02.rpy:126
translate schinese case2_0174e8b3:

    # marisa_t "And honestly? I'm not the only one around here with sticky fingers."
    marisa_t "而且说实话，这一带手脚不干净的可不止我一个。"

# game/case02.rpy:130
translate schinese case2_9a789c8f:

    # eiki "Your witness, Junior Judge. [spirit_Word!t] magatama of spirit, as always."
    eiki "证人交给你了，见习法官。灵力勾玉照旧是[spirit_Word!t]枚。"

# game/case02.rpy:144
translate schinese case2_cross_fde6d5e6:

    # eiki "Again. She'll still be here. Unfortunately."
    eiki "再来。她还在这儿。很遗憾。"

# game/case02.rpy:155
translate schinese case2_breakthrough_a8d47f37:

    # you "Reimu's donation box isn't on trial today. Your forty-seven books are."
    you "今天受审的不是灵梦的赛钱箱，是你的四十七本书。"

# game/case02.rpy:156
translate schinese case2_breakthrough_247e476c:

    # you "Even if she's guilty, that doesn't return a single grimoire."
    you "就算她有罪，也还不回一本魔导书。"

# game/case02.rpy:159
translate schinese case2_breakthrough_0af1229f:

    # marisa "Hey! I was making a comparison! A really convincing one!"
    marisa "喂！我只是打个比方！很有说服力的那种！"

# game/case02.rpy:163
translate schinese case2_breakthrough_266a902e:

    # eiki "Tu quoque. \"You too.\""
    eiki "“你也一样”谬误。“你不也是吗”。"

# game/case02.rpy:164
translate schinese case2_breakthrough_a8ccd7dc:

    # eiki "Another's wrongdoing does not make yours right. It only makes two."
    eiki "别人做错事，并不能让你做的变对。只会变成两件错事。"

# game/case02.rpy:165
translate schinese case2_breakthrough_83e8ebfe:

    # eiki "Two thieves do not add up to zero thieves."
    eiki "两个小偷加起来，不会等于零个小偷。"

# game/case02.rpy:172
translate schinese case2_breakthrough_7170311c:

    # eiki "Defendant Kirisame Marisa. This court finds you..."
    eiki "被告雾雨魔理沙。本庭判决你……"

# game/case02.rpy:183
translate schinese case2_breakthrough_dc5bf327:

    # eiki "Sentence: return all forty-seven books. Alphabetised. While Patchouli watches."
    eiki "判决：归还全部四十七本书。按字母顺序排好。在帕秋莉的注视下。"

# game/case02.rpy:186
translate schinese case2_breakthrough_56abae37:

    # marisa "Can I borrow a pen to sign that?"
    marisa "签字的话，能借支笔吗？"

# game/case02.rpy:189
translate schinese case2_breakthrough_6063f5e0:

    # eiki "Bailiff."
    eiki "法警。"

# game/case02.rpy:190
translate schinese case2_breakthrough_ce8461be:

    # komachi "On it, boss."
    komachi "这就去，四季大人。"

# game/case02.rpy:202
translate schinese case2_breakthrough_84d7d5bf:

    # eiki "...Through the window."
    eiki "……又是窗户。"

# game/case02.rpy:203
translate schinese case2_breakthrough_11899929:

    # komachi "She seemed to prefer it."
    komachi "她好像更喜欢那边。"

# game/case02.rpy:204
translate schinese case2_breakthrough_3d82d9a4:

    # eiki "Court is adjourned."
    eiki "退庭。"

translate schinese strings:

    # game/case02.rpy:8
    old "Library Ledger"
    new "图书馆借阅簿"

    # game/case02.rpy:8
    old "Forty-seven grimoires signed out to \"M. Kirisame.\" None returned."
    new "四十七本魔导书借给了“M·雾雨”。一本未还。"

    # game/case02.rpy:10
    old "Shrine Donation Box"
    new "神社赛钱箱"

    # game/case02.rpy:10
    old "Nearly empty. Contents: one leaf, one button."
    new "几乎是空的。内容物：一片叶子，一颗纽扣。"

    # game/case02.rpy:12
    old "Patchouli's Spare Glasses"
    new "帕秋莉的备用眼镜"

    # game/case02.rpy:12
    old "Dusty. Found under a stack of unread books."
    new "满是灰尘。在一堆没读过的书下面找到。"

    # game/case02.rpy:15
    old "The Forty-Seven Grimoires"
    new "四十七本魔导书"

    # game/case02.rpy:15
    old "I borrowed those books. I'll give 'em back when I die. That's a promise."
    new "那些书是我借的。等我死了就还。我保证。"

    # game/case02.rpy:15
    old "A terrible promise is still a promise. Rude, yes. Illogical, no."
    new "再糟糕的承诺也是承诺。很失礼，但并不违反逻辑。"

    # game/case02.rpy:15
    old "Patchouli hasn't opened most of 'em in a hundred years. I checked the dust."
    new "那些书大部分帕秋莉一百年都没翻过。我查过灰尘了。"

    # game/case02.rpy:15
    old "Dust is evidence. Annoyingly good evidence. The bad step is somewhere else."
    new "灰尘是证据。好得让人恼火的证据。出错的那一步在别处。"

    # game/case02.rpy:15
    old "And honestly? I'm not the only one around here with sticky fingers."
    new "而且说实话，这一带手脚不干净的可不止我一个。"

    # game/case02.rpy:15
    old "That's a hint, not an argument. Press her and make her say it."
    new "那只是暗示，不是论证。追问她，让她说出来。"

    # game/case02.rpy:15
    old "Reimu pockets her own donation box! So who's the real thief here? Not me."
    new "灵梦都偷自己的赛钱箱！到底谁才是真小偷？反正不是我。"

    # game/case02.rpy:15
    old "Close. But she isn't insulting her accuser. She's hiding behind someone else's sins. There's a sharper name for that."
    new "接近了。但她没有侮辱指控她的人，而是躲在别人的罪过后面。这有个更准确的名字。"

    # game/case02.rpy:15
    old "Slippery Slope needs a chain of disasters. She predicted nothing. She just pointed at Reimu."
    new "滑坡谬误需要一连串的灾难。她什么也没预言，只是指了指灵梦。"

    # game/case02.rpy:15
    old "Nobody is mistaking order for cause. She is pointing at Reimu to excuse herself."
    new "没人把先后当成因果。她指着灵梦，是为了给自己开脱。"

    # game/case02.rpy:15
    old "That has nothing to do with the forty-seven books. Show what she actually took."
    new "那跟四十七本书毫无关系。拿出能证明她实际拿走了什么的东西。"

